| same, κ units | −15.6343 / −1.79e−14 / +24.1164 | 0.962855 ± 10.1434 | 112 / 1 / 111 | — | — |
| nominal full 48 vs scalar full trajectory | −1.83105e−4 / 0 / +1.74309e7 | 1.60265e5 ± 1.36172e6 | 99 / 15 / 110 | −1.45519e−11 / −9.09495e−13 / +9.09495e−12 | −4.47035e−6 / 0 / +8.71543e6 |
