For nominal full-48, only 5/224 rows differed by more than one bit; the other 219 were within 2.13623×10⁻⁴ bit. The five outliers ranged up to 17,430,862.222 bits = 0.0204082 κ. Realised full-48 stayed within 3.21572×10⁻¹³ κ throughout.

Binary64 equality counts out of 224:

